sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor GuardA as Security Guard A
    actor GuardB as Security Guard B (Concurrent Racer)
    participant Service as PickupService
    participant DB as MongoDB (Atomic Engine)

    Note over GuardA, GuardB: Both guards submit the exact same pickup code at Gate No. 2
    par Concurrent Requests
        GuardA->>Service: verify_and_handover(code="849201")
        GuardB->>Service: verify_and_handover(code="849201")
    end

    Note over Service, DB: Atomic CAS Token Invalidation
    Service->>DB: find_one_and_update({id: 301, used_at: null}, {$set: {used_at: now}})
    Note over DB: Guard A arrives first -> Matches token
    DB-->>Service: Token Document (Guard A WINS race)

    Service->>DB: find_one_and_update({id: 301, used_at: null}, {$set: {used_at: now}})
    Note over DB: Guard B arrives -> used_at is already set!
    DB-->>Service: null (Guard B FAILS race)

    Service->>DB: insert_one(pickup_records), update(package, status=COLLECTED)
    Service-->>GuardA: 200 OK (Handover Completed Successfully)
    Service-->>GuardB: 409 Conflict (Token Already Used / ALREADY_COLLECTED)
